# Applied by Cloudflare to static responses (not to the Worker's). Everything under /assets/ has a
# content hash in its name (the JS, the CSS and the font), so a browser may keep it for good; a
# changed file gets a new name. The pages and the photographs keep the default revalidation, since
# a photograph is re-exported under the same name.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
